---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import noonPilgrimageCharacter from "@/assets/images/portfolio/noon-pilgrimage-character.webp";
import redTideCharacter from "@/assets/images/portfolio/red-tide-character.webp";
import weekEightCharacter from "@/assets/images/portfolio/week-eight-character.webp";
import PortfolioLayout from "@/layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro";
---

<PortfolioLayout title="多角色一致性：设定压力测试" description="以三组原创角色设定对照角色锚点、差异化与 AIGC 生成后的检查口径。" ogImage={noonPilgrimageCharacter.src}>
	<header class="project-hero site-shell"><p class="project-kicker">Character Case / Consistency Lab</p><h1 class="project-title">多角色一致性：先固定，再变化。</h1><p class="project-lead">面对多套角色，不用“风格差不多”代替可交付的设定。每个角色先定义轮廓、主色、核心道具和不能漂移的部位，再把不同人物放在同一套复核规则中检查。</p><div class="project-meta"><div><span class="meta-label">Scope</span><strong>三组角色设定对照</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Focus</span><strong>识别锚点 / 漂移排查</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Output</span><strong>设定板 / QA 口径</strong></div><div><span class="meta-label">Status</span><strong>原创概念研究</strong></div></div></header>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / Comparison</p><h2>人物不同，复核逻辑相同。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><p>照霜、雾灯和唐小满分别服务时间巡礼、深海维护与便利店叙事。它们在题材与主色上拉开差距，但三组设定都保留正侧角度、面部阅读、服装结构和签名道具，让后续分镜、组图或生成候选有明确的参照物。</p><div class="decision-table"><div class="decision-table__head"><span>角色</span><span>可见锚点</span><span>生成后优先检查</span></div><div><b>照霜 / 无昼巡礼</b><span>浅色发型、深色外套、伞与日晷意象。</span><span>伞的结构、服装分区、冷暖关系与时间系统符号。</span></div><div><b>雾灯 / 赤潮信标</b><span>深海装备、信号焰、环礁维护语境。</span><span>潜水装备逻辑、道具比例、材质与环境关系。</span></div><div><b>唐小满 / 星期八便利店</b><span>暖色人物、门店制服与日常道具。</span><span>面部年龄感、制服识别、手持物和日常场景比例。</span></div></div></div></section>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">02 / Character Boards</p><h2>设定板是生成的参照，不是装饰。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><div class="detail-gallery"><figure><Image src={noonPilgrimageCharacter} alt="照霜的原创角色设定板" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>照霜</b><span>以时间装置与伞形配件建立轮廓和道具锚点。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={redTideCharacter} alt="雾灯的原创角色设定板" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>雾灯</b><span>以深海维护装备和信号元素建立功能身份。</span></figcaption></figure><figure><Image src={weekEightCharacter} alt="唐小满的原创角色设定板" widths={[640, 960, 1400]} sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" /><figcaption><b>唐小满</b><span>以暖色日常人物和便利店任务建立生活化阅读。</span></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>

	<section class="site-shell case-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / QA Gate</p><h2>先拒绝漂移，再保留可用候选。</h2></div><div class="case-body"><p>不同角色进入 AIGC 流程时，检查项可以复用：人物数是否正确、脸部和发色是否稳定、服装结构与关键道具是否保留、手部关系是否可信、背景是否支持而非吞没人物。满足这些基础后，才讨论构图、情绪与细节精修。</p><div class="system-map"><div class="system-node system-node--acid"><span>01 / BASELINE</span><strong>设定板</strong></div><div class="system-node"><span>02 / CANDIDATES</span><strong>多图筛选</strong></div><div class="system-node system-node--ice"><span>03 / REJECT</span><strong>漂移与错误</strong></div><div class="system-node"><span>04 / RELEASE</span><strong>可进入分镜</strong></div></div><p class="boundary-note">本页展示的是原创角色的设计与 QA 方法。它不将概念研究表述为已发布漫画、商业授权素材或正式 AIGC 成片。</p></div></section>
</PortfolioLayout>
